second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Where is the News Democrat published?\", \"slot_hint\": \"place\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"Belleville News-Democrat The Belleville News-Democrat is a daily newspaper in Belleville, Illinois.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 100, \"end\": 225, \"text\": \"Focusing on news that is local to the area of southwestern Illinois, it has been published under various names for 150 years.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 226, \"end\": 299, \"text\": \"As of 2009, it is published by The McClatchy Company, and is based in St.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 300, \"end\": 323, \"text\": \"Clair County, Illinois.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 324, \"end\": 383, \"text\": \"It publishes content in print as well as online at bnd.com.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 384, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"The \\\"Belleville News-Democrat\\\" was founded in 1858 as the \\\"Weekly Democrat\\\".\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 461, \"end\": 559, \"text\": \"In the early 1860s, it merged with the \\\"Belleville News\\\" to become the \\\"Belleville News-Democrat\\\".\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d00\", \"start\": 560, \"end\": 625, \"text\": \"It was a family-owned newspaper until 1972, when it was purchased\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 75, \"text\": \"The Belleville News-Democrat is a daily newspaper in Springfield, Illinois.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 76, \"end\": 201, \"text\": \"Focusing on news that is local to the area of southwestern Illinois, it has been published under various names for 150 years.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 202, \"end\": 275, \"text\": \"As of 2009, it is published by The McClatchy Company, and is based in St.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 276, \"end\": 299, \"text\": \"Clair County, Illinois.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 300, \"end\": 359, \"text\": \"It publishes content in print as well as online at bnd.com.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 360, \"end\": 436, \"text\": \"The \\\"Belleville News-Democrat\\\" was founded in 1858 as the \\\"Weekly Democrat\\\".\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 437, \"end\": 535, \"text\": \"In the early 1860s, it merged with the \\\"Belleville News\\\" to become the \\\"Belleville News-Democrat\\\".\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d01\", \"start\": 536, \"end\": 602, \"text\": \"It was a family-owned newspaper until 1972, when it was purchased.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 104, \"text\": \"News-Democrat & Leader The News-Democrat & Leader is a twice-weekly newspaper in Russellville, Kentucky.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 184, \"text\": \"It has been published since 1806, fourteen years after Kentucky became a state.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 185, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"Russellville is the county seat of Logan County.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"The current title was formed with the merging of \\\"The Logan County News\\\" and \\\"The Democrat\\\" in 1911.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 424, \"text\": \"Then in 1968, employees of the \\\"News-Democrat\\\" started a paper called \\\"The Logan Leader\\\".\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 425, \"end\": 552, \"text\": \"A few months later, this was merged back into the original company, which published the papers under different names each week.\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d02\", \"start\": 553, \"end\": 619, \"text\": \"In the 1990s, this was changed to a publication under the combined\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0278-2db293af3119:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 662, \"text\": \"at polls US Crime News Laundrie ’ s parents rail against ‘ inaccuracies ’ in Petito documentary US politics Florida is rushing to enforce new immigration laws – what to know News Sweeping restrictions on semiautomatic firearms move forward in Colorado US politics Bannon calls Musk a ‘ parasitic illegal immigrant ’ in latest jab Get in touch Contact us Our Products Register Newsletters Donate Today ’ s Edition Install our app Archive Other publications International editions Independent en Español Independent Arabia Independent Turkish Independent Persian Independent Urdu The Standard Extras Puzzles All topics Betting Offers Voucher codes Competitions and\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs